<title>INDIA: SOCCER-NEHRU GOLD CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NEHRU GOLD CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraq beat China  2-0 (halftime 1-0) in the opening preliminary league match of the five-nation Nehru Gold Cup international soccer tournament on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Hayder Majeed 30, Alla Jabbar 60.</p>
</text>
